          "id": 1746494407,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hmm, technically RFC 7587 registers \"opus\" in lower case. All the other ones match the case as registered, even though [RFC 8866](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8866.html#section-5.14-3.8.5) says that it doesn't matter (and we compare it case-insensitively anyway.)",
